menu "esp-sr application"

    config APP_CONSOLE
        bool "Console that writes NVS over UART"
        default n
        help
            On in dev, bench and ci. A shipped build must not carry a console
            that can rewrite every NVS key (KEHOACH 6.2).

    config APP_SPEAKER_ENABLE
        bool "Speaker fitted: open I2S TX and run noi_task"
        default n
        help
            Board B has no amplifier until E10. Off means drv_audio opens RX
            only, noi_task is never created, and replies stay MQTT events
            (KEHOACH 2.1).

    config APP_PCM_SHIFT_FALLBACK
        int "Microphone right shift until calib/pcm_shift is measured"
        range 8 16
        default 16
        help
            drv_audio keeps the top 32 - shift bits of each INMP441 slot.
            test_apps/calib writes the measured value to NVS calib/pcm_shift,
            which wins over this one (KEHOACH 6.2).

    config SR_PROFILING
        bool "Per-module timing into the bench CSV"
        default n
        help
            On only in the bench profile, the one profile numbers are
            reported from (KEHOACH 4.5.8).

endmenu
